---
title: Delivery pipeline
---
flowchart LR
    push([Push]) --> lint[Lint]
    push --> unit[Unit tests]
    push --> build[Build image]
    build --> scan[Image scan]
    lint --> gate{All green?}
    unit --> gate
    scan --> gate
    gate -->|yes| staging[Deploy to staging]
    gate -->|no| fix[Fix and push again]
    fix --> push
    staging --> e2e[End-to-end tests]
    e2e --> approve{Approved?}
    approve -->|yes| prod[Deploy to production]
    approve -->|no| fix
    prod --> smoke[Smoke tests]
    smoke -->|fails| rollback[Roll back]
